@startuml pipeline
title mogov run: how a full refresh flows

|Loaders (stage 1)|
start
:mogov load (all stage-1 loaders);
note right
  Each loader lists its work units and
  processes those its shard owns:
  crc32(unit key) % shards == shard.
  --shards N        process pool of N
  --shards N --shard i   one shard
  Cloud Run: CLOUD_RUN_TASK_COUNT/INDEX
end note
fork
  :fetch (cached HTTP, data/cache);
fork again
  :parse PDFs / XML / HTML
  to text rows (no shaping);
end fork
:stream rows to
data/raw/<table>/part-<i>-of-<N>.parquet;

|dbt|
:mogov build (dbt build);
note right
  sources read <table>/*.parquet;
  empty placeholders for optional
  JSON tables that aren't loaded
end note
:staging -> intermediate -> marts;

|Loaders (stage 2)|
:courtlistener_cases
(needs marts.fct_legal_careers);

|dbt|
:mogov build;
:mogov export (optional)
data/exports/*.csv|parquet;
stop
@enduml
